        "text": "\u00bb  Installing the LibreOffice suite\n\u00bb\n\u00bb  Completing office tasks: LibreOffice\nWriter (word processing), Calc\n(spreadsheets), and Impress\n(presentations)\n\u00bb\n\u00bb  Using other programs: LibreOffice\nDraw (drawing), Base (database), and\nMath (formulas)\n220   PART 3 Getting Things Done\nover to the Apache Foundation, which renamed it Apache OpenOffice. Both Apache\nOpenOffice and LibreOffice have similar features, but it appears at least as of now,\nthat LibreOffice is the more popular of the two packages and is commonly installed\nby default in most Linux distributions.",
